{"4207000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curse of Cards", "steam_appid": 4207000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through a shifting cosmic library in this roguelike card-crawler. Combine satisfying card strategy with first-person exploration. Unleash ancient creatures of British folklore, gather relics, collect powerful cards, and fight to shape your own story escaping the cursed library’s grasp. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/3da74f4f14c52b67b6463fe9e1b4296d.poster.avif?t=1788342706\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/3da74f4f14c52b67b6463fe9e1b4296d.webm?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/3da74f4f14c52b67b6463fe9e1b4296d.mp4?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight with cards drawn from real-world ancient British folklore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/ae5f9c926c4cb0bfe893cd1c0247a7e9.poster.avif?t=1788342706\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/ae5f9c926c4cb0bfe893cd1c0247a7e9.webm?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/ae5f9c926c4cb0bfe893cd1c0247a7e9.mp4?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Traverse a fully-3D library between card matches and discover merchants, upgrades and hidden secrets between. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/f472ad80093268c74156403eeabbed84.poster.avif?t=1788342706\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/f472ad80093268c74156403eeabbed84.webm?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/f472ad80093268c74156403eeabbed84.mp4?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new items and cards, or upgrade your existing arsenal to aid in your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/389293d25268c79b3b8768ae5a3c1ce9.poster.avif?t=1788342706\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/389293d25268c79b3b8768ae5a3c1ce9.webm?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/389293d25268c79b3b8768ae5a3c1ce9.mp4?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The walls shift in this mysterious library at the space between spaces. Who knows what things lay hidden beyond the surface? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Draw cards from a shared deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creatures and Events inspired by ancient British folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gather Curses to make your game harder and harder... wait, maybe avoid the Curses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A randomised world keeps the game fresh each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Escape the trap of this cosmic library.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through a shifting cosmic library in this roguelike card-crawler. Combine satisfying card strategy with first-person exploration. Unleash ancient creatures of British folklore, gather relics, collect powerful cards, and fight to shape your own story escaping the cursed library’s grasp. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/3da74f4f14c52b67b6463fe9e1b4296d.poster.avif?t=1788342706\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/3da74f4f14c52b67b6463fe9e1b4296d.webm?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/3da74f4f14c52b67b6463fe9e1b4296d.mp4?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight with cards drawn from real-world ancient British folklore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/ae5f9c926c4cb0bfe893cd1c0247a7e9.poster.avif?t=1788342706\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/ae5f9c926c4cb0bfe893cd1c0247a7e9.webm?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207000/extras/ae5f9c926c4cb0bfe893cd1c0247a7e9.mp4?t=1788342706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Traverse a fully-3D library between card matches and discover merchants, upgrades and hidden secrets between. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_